{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52966","headline":"游枋口（幷序） 蒙泉 · 郑辕","name":"游枋口（幷序） 蒙泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹洞吐细泉，宛转苍苔里。\n凝碧时含光，流泄复如此。\n谁知山下泉，来洗幽人耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑辕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}